        "name": "USN-8883-2",
        "description": "USN-8883-1 fixed a vulnerability in Go versions 1.18, 1.21, and 1.24. This update provides the corresponding fix for Go version 1.23.  Original advisory details:   It was discovered that the Go x/net/idna package incorrectly handled  certain Punycode-encoded labels that decoded to ASCII-only labels. An  attacker could possibly use this issue to bypass hostname-based access  controls and escalate privileges.",
